2026-11-18 09:00-10:00 Design review
2026-11-20 19:30-21:00 Movie night
2026-11-22 17:00-18:00 Write a blog post	alert=none
2026-11-23 09:30-10:00 Weekly stand-up	loc=Room A	repeat=weekly
2026-11-24 12:00-13:00 Lunch with Grace	loc=Dawn Roasters
2026-11-25 10:30-11:30 Dentist check-up	loc=Spring Light Dental	alert=60
2026-11-26 14:00-16:00 Quarterly review	loc=HQ, 3rd floor	note=10 slides
2026-11-27 18:00-20:00 Mum's birthday dinner	loc=Madison
2026-11-28 Flea market
2026-11-29 10:00-12:00 Running club	loc=Riverside park	repeat=weekly
2026-12-01 09:00-18:00 Release day	note=New NanumOS version
2026-12-03 19:00-21:00 Book club: Little Women	loc=Harbor Library
2026-12-05 Lily's wedding	loc=Phoenix
2026-12-08 15:00-16:00 Call with Emma (Northwind)	loc=video
2026-12-12 11:00-13:00 Year-end brunch	loc=Harbor Bakery
2026-12-24 Christmas Eve	repeat=yearly
2026-12-31 22:00-23:59 Wrapping up the year
rule r1
name Morning briefing
on 0
when cron:0 9 * * *
step report Tell me today's tasks and events in a few lines
last 1 11-22 09:00|ok
fails 0
end
rule r2
name Wrap up the day
on 0
when cron:30 17 * * 1-5
step act todo add_task title=Plan tomorrow
step report Sum up what I finished today in one line
last 1 11-21 17:30|ok
fails 0
end
rule r3
name Weekend shopping note
on 0
when cron:0 10 * * 6
step act keep create_note title=Shopping text=milk, eggs, mandarins
last 0 11-16 10:00|Keep was not running
fails 0
end
rule r4
name Tell me about new downloads
on 0
when file:Downloads
step report Tell me what the newly received file is
fails 0
end
