title=Nanum Notes
desc=Photos, trips, kitchen days and books from Hanbyeol, who designs NanumOS at Zeus Software
author=Hanbyeol
base=
theme=warm
layout=about,labels,archive,recent,search
perpage=6
c1a2b301	hello-world	published	Nanum Blog	2026-09-28 10:12	This is the first comment. You can approve or delete comments in the Comments screen.
c1a2b302	autumn-hanok	published	Leo Santos	2026-10-12 20:05	The sky in the second photo is gorgeous. Going there next week!
c1a2b303	kimbap-picnic	published	Theo Morgan	2026-11-07 13:40	Thanks to the sesame-oil-on-the-knife tip my rolls held together for the first time.
c1a2b304	nanumos-palette	published	Grace Lee	2026-11-11 19:22	"Clear roles make it richer" - quoting that in our next review.
c1a2b305	night-city-photo	published	Felix Young	2026-11-03 08:30	Blue hour really changes everything. Thanks for sharing the settings.
c1a2b306	dawn-lake-books	awaiting	Ava Martin	2026-11-19 09:02	I'm rereading Jane Eyre too. Looking forward to next month's list.
c1a2b307	seorak-winter	awaiting	Mateo Silva	2026-10-26 18:44	Which crampons do you use? It is hard to choose the first pair.
c1a2b308	window-cat	published	Ivy Parker	2026-10-27 22:10	Rule two is my favourite. My cat is exactly the same.
