title: A window, a first snow, and the stars
status: published
date: 2026-11-18 21:10
labels: daily, photos
desc: The night the clouds finally cleared
comments: on
image: media/night.jpg
---
It had been weeks since the clouds lifted. I turned off the lights, opened the window, and there were more stars than I expected.

## How I shot it

- No tripod: the camera rested on the window frame
- 15 seconds, ISO 1600
- The shutter was on a timer

Holding my breath for fifteen seconds felt strangely long, and good. Tomorrow I will go a little further out.
