zmb 1
h	From	NanumOS <hello@example.com>
h	Subject	Welcome to Mail

This is a sample inbox, so you can look around: open a message, star it, archive it, or write one with the Compose button.

To use your own mail, open the account picture at the top right and choose Add another account.
zmb 1
h	From	Mina Seo <mina@example.net>
h	Subject	Photos from the cafe

The window seat photos came out lovely, the afternoon light is the best part. I put three in the shared folder.

Mina
zmb 1
h	From	NanumOS Docs Team <docs@example.com>
h	Subject	New document templates are here

We added three templates: meeting notes, report and contract. Press "New document" in the Documents app.

NanumOS Docs Team
zmb 1
h	From	Rina Park <rina@example.org>
h	Subject	Weekend plans

Thinking of the market on Saturday and a long walk after. Want to join? We can have lunch at the noodle place.

Rina
zmb 1
h	From	Cafe Supplies <orders@supplies.example>
h	Subject	Order #4821 has shipped

Your order of yuzu syrup (6 bottles) and barley tea (4 packs) is on its way. Expected on Thursday.
zmb 1
h	From	Sujin Lee <sujin@example.kr>
h	Subject	Where we meet next week

Next week we meet at the hanok cafe by the station, at 7. Please be on time.

Sujin
zmb 1
h	From	Library <hello@library.example>
h	Subject	Your books are ready

Two books you reserved are ready at the front desk. They will be kept for five days.
zmb 1
h	From	Tomas Lind <tomas@example.org>
h	Subject	Notes from the call

Here are the three points we agreed: ship on Friday, share the draft on Monday, review together on Wednesday.

Tomas
zmb 1
h	From	Zeus Team <hello@example.com>
h	Subject	Tip: keyboard shortcuts

Press c to write, e to archive, s to star and / to search. Everything you do here stays in this browser.
zmb 1
h	From	Jimin Park <jimin@example.kr>
h	Subject	Happy birthday

Have a warm and tasty day. I will bring a cake in the evening.

Jimin
zmb 1
h	From	Hana Choi <hana@example.net>
h	Subject	Lunch on Thursday?

Are you free around noon on Thursday? The new place near the station has a quiet room.

Hana
zmb 1
h	From	Younghee Lee <younghee@example.kr>
h	Subject	Please confirm the meeting schedule

Hello. Here is next week's meeting schedule. Please tell me a time that suits you.

Younghee
zmb 1
h	From	Sam Reed <sam@example.org>
h	Subject	Trip photos

I put the photos from the weekend hike in a shared folder. The one at the summit came out best.

Sam
zmb 1
h	From	Shop News <news@shop.example>
h	Subject	Weekly picks

Five small things people liked this week. This is a sample newsletter.
zmb 1
h	From	Alex Moon <alex@example.com>
h	Subject	Budget review

I went through the numbers again and everything adds up. Only the travel line needs a second look.

Alex
zmb 1
h	From	Chulsoo Kim <chulsoo@example.kr>
h	Subject	Sending the estimate

The estimate you asked for is attached. Tell me what you think after you look.

Chulsoo
zmb 1
h	From	Park Sora <sora@example.org>
h	Subject	Reading list

Three books for the winter: a short novel, a field guide, and a collection of essays. Tell me what you think.

Sora
zmb 1
h	From	Jeju Air Sample <booking@airline.example>
h	Subject	Your boarding pass for Saturday

Your flight to Jeju leaves Saturday at 08:40. Gate and seat are on the attached pass. This is a sample message.
